{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26292","headline":"汴州船行赋岸傍所见 · 沈亚之","name":"汴州船行赋岸傍所见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古木晓苍苍，秋林拂岸香。\n露珠虫网细，金缕兔丝长。\n秋浪时回沫，惊鳞乍触航。\n蓬烟拈绿线，棘实缀红囊。\n乱穗摇鼯尾，出根挂凤肠。\n聊持一濯足，谁道比沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}